{"title":"前缀和与差分算法详解","slug":"2024-04-10-前缀和与差分算法","date":"2024-04-10T04:56:08.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:50:12.163Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-04-10-前缀和与差分算法.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前缀和算法\"><a href=\"#前缀和算法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前缀和算法\"></a>前缀和算法</h2><p>前缀和是一种高效且基础的算法思想，常用于处理区间计算问题。其核心优势在于通过简单的预处理，将后续的区间查询复杂度从线性级 $O(n)$ 降低至常数级 $O(1)$，属于典型的“以空间换时间”策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心概念与递推公式\"><a href=\"#核心概念与递推公式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心概念与递推公式\"></a>核心概念与递推公式</h3><p>假设给定一个长度为 $n$ 的数组 $a[1] \\sim a[n]$，定义前缀和数组 $S$，其中 $S[i]$ 表示数组前 $i$ 个元素之和：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S[i] = a[1] + a[2] + \\dots + a[i]</script><h4 id=\"1-预处理\"><a href=\"#1-预处理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 预处理\"></a>1. 预处理</h4><p>利用递推思想，我们可以在 $O(n)$ 的时间复杂度内计算出所有前缀和：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S[i] = S[i-1] + a[i]</script><h4 id=\"2-区间查询\"><a href=\"#2-区间查询\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 区间查询\"></a>2. 区间查询</h4><p>一旦预计算出前缀和数组，任意区间 $[i, j]$ 的元素之和即可通过端点值快速得出：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\\sum_{k=i}^{j} a[k] = a[i] + a[i+1] + \\dots + a[j] = S[j] - S[i-1]</script><p><strong>复杂度分析</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>传统暴力枚举求区间和：$O(n)$</li>\n<li>前缀和优化后：$O(1)$</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战例题\"><a href=\"#实战例题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实战例题\"></a>实战例题</h2><p><strong>解题思路提示</strong>：当建模发现题目中包含频繁的区间求和操作时，应优先考虑使用前缀和进行优化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"例一：0求和\"><a href=\"#例一：0求和\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"例一：0求和\"></a>例一：0求和</h3><blockquote>\n<p>题目来源：蓝桥云课</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 id=\"题目分析\"><a href=\"#题目分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目分析\"></a>题目分析</h4><p>假设题目要求计算特定形式的乘积之和。我们需要对计算式进行数学变形，提取其中的重复计算部分。</p>\n<p>原式可表示为：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S = (a_1 + \\dots + a_{n-1}) \\times a_n + (a_1 + \\dots + a_{n-2}) \\times a_{n-1} + \\dots + a_1 \\times a_2</script><p>观察发现，括号内的部分正是前缀和 $S[i]$。设 $S[i] = \\sum_{k=1}^{i} a_k$，则上式可改写为：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S = S[n-1] \\times a_n + S[n-2] \\times a_{n-1} + \\dots + S[1] \\times a_2</script><h4 id=\"算法实现\"><a href=\"#算法实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法实现\"></a>算法实现</h4><ol>\n<li><strong>预处理</strong>：通过一次循环递推计算出 $S[1] \\sim S[n-1]$。</li>\n<li><strong>计算</strong>：再次遍历数组，根据变形后的公式累加求和。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"代码参考\"><a href=\"#代码参考\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码参考\"></a>代码参考</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 读取输入</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 为了方便索引从1开始，在头部补0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">a = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] + [<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(i) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split()] </span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定义前缀和数组，初始化为0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">prefix_sum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 预计算前缀和 prefix_sum[1] ~ prefix_sum[n-1]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefix_sum[i] = prefix_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] + a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 计算最终结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 对应公式：S[i] * a[i+1]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans += prefix_sum[i] * a[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 例二：可获得的最小取值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; 题目来源：蓝桥云课</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 题目分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">题目通常涉及两种操作，且需要求最小代价。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> **排序预处理**：首先将数组 $a[]$ 从小到大排序。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> **操作策略**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">   - 操作(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)：在数组尾部选取元素。</span><br><span class=\"line\">   - 操作(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)：在数组头部选取<span class=\"number\">2</span>个元素。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**贪心法的陷阱**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">直观上容易想到贪心策略：每次选择代价较小的操作。但贪心法往往是错误的。例如样例 $\\&#123;<span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>\\&#125;$，若 $k=<span class=\"number\">3</span>$：</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 贪心策略：执行<span class=\"number\">3</span>次操作(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)，结果为 $<span class=\"number\">1</span>\\times1 + <span class=\"number\">1</span>\\times1 + <span class=\"number\">1</span>\\times1 = <span class=\"number\">6</span>$（此处逻辑视具体题意而定，假设是累加或特定权值）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 正确策略：执行<span class=\"number\">3</span>次操作(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)，取尾部元素，结果可能更优。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 优化思路：枚举 + 前缀和</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">既然贪心不可行，我们需要遍历所有可能的操作组合。设操作(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)执行了 $p$ 次，则操作(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)执行了 $k-p$ 次。此时总代价公式为：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">$$ Cost(p) = \\sum_&#123;i=<span class=\"number\">1</span>&#125;^&#123;2p&#125; a_i + \\sum_&#123;i=n-(k-p)+<span class=\"number\">1</span>&#125;^&#123;n&#125; a_i $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">若直接按照公式计算，每次验证 $p$ 的复杂度为 $O(n)$，总复杂度为 $O(kn)$，在数据量大时会超时。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**前缀和优化**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">观察公式发现，两部分的求和均可通过前缀和数组直接访问：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> 前半部分（头部 $2p$ 个元素）：即为 `S[2p]`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> 后半部分（尾部 $k-p$ 个元素）：可通过 `S[n] - S[n-(k-p)]` 快速计算。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过前缀和优化，单次验证 $p$ 的复杂度降为 $O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$，整体复杂度优化为 $O(n \\log n + k)$（排序耗时 + 枚举耗时）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 代码逻辑简述</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 伪代码示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># a.sort() </span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># prefix_sum = ... (计算前缀和)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># min_val = infinity</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># for p in range(0, k + 1):</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     head_sum = prefix_sum[2*p]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     tail_count = k - p</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     tail_sum = prefix_sum[n] - prefix_sum[n - tail_count]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     min_val = min(min_val, head_sum + tail_sum)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">*(注：具体代码边界需根据题目详细要求调整)*</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"前缀和算法\"><a href=\"#前缀和算法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前缀和算法\"></a>前缀和算法</h2><p>前缀和是一种高效且基础的算法思想，常用于处理区间计算问题。其核心优势在于通过简单的预处理，将后续的区间查询复杂度从线性级 $O(n)$ 降低至常数级 $O(1)$，属于典型的“以空间换时间”策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心概念与递推公式\"><a href=\"#核心概念与递推公式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心概念与递推公式\"></a>核心概念与递推公式</h3><p>假设给定一个长度为 $n$ 的数组 $a[1] \\sim a[n]$，定义前缀和数组 $S$，其中 $S[i]$ 表示数组前 $i$ 个元素之和：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S[i] = a[1] + a[2] + \\dots + a[i]</script><h4 id=\"1-预处理\"><a href=\"#1-预处理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 预处理\"></a>1. 预处理</h4><p>利用递推思想，我们可以在 $O(n)$ 的时间复杂度内计算出所有前缀和：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S[i] = S[i-1] + a[i]</script><h4 id=\"2-区间查询\"><a href=\"#2-区间查询\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 区间查询\"></a>2. 区间查询</h4><p>一旦预计算出前缀和数组，任意区间 $[i, j]$ 的元素之和即可通过端点值快速得出：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\\sum_{k=i}^{j} a[k] = a[i] + a[i+1] + \\dots + a[j] = S[j] - S[i-1]</script><p><strong>复杂度分析</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>传统暴力枚举求区间和：$O(n)$</li>\n<li>前缀和优化后：$O(1)$</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战例题\"><a href=\"#实战例题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实战例题\"></a>实战例题</h2><p><strong>解题思路提示</strong>：当建模发现题目中包含频繁的区间求和操作时，应优先考虑使用前缀和进行优化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"例一：0求和\"><a href=\"#例一：0求和\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"例一：0求和\"></a>例一：0求和</h3><blockquote>\n<p>题目来源：蓝桥云课</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 id=\"题目分析\"><a href=\"#题目分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目分析\"></a>题目分析</h4><p>假设题目要求计算特定形式的乘积之和。我们需要对计算式进行数学变形，提取其中的重复计算部分。</p>\n<p>原式可表示为：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S = (a_1 + \\dots + a_{n-1}) \\times a_n + (a_1 + \\dots + a_{n-2}) \\times a_{n-1} + \\dots + a_1 \\times a_2</script><p>观察发现，括号内的部分正是前缀和 $S[i]$。设 $S[i] = \\sum_{k=1}^{i} a_k$，则上式可改写为：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S = S[n-1] \\times a_n + S[n-2] \\times a_{n-1} + \\dots + S[1] \\times a_2</script><h4 id=\"算法实现\"><a href=\"#算法实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法实现\"></a>算法实现</h4><ol>\n<li><strong>预处理</strong>：通过一次循环递推计算出 $S[1] \\sim S[n-1]$。</li>\n<li><strong>计算</strong>：再次遍历数组，根据变形后的公式累加求和。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"代码参考\"><a href=\"#代码参考\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码参考\"></a>代码参考</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 读取输入</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 为了方便索引从1开始，在头部补0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">a = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] + [<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(i) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split()] </span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定义前缀和数组，初始化为0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">prefix_sum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 预计算前缀和 prefix_sum[1] ~ prefix_sum[n-1]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefix_sum[i] = prefix_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] + a[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 计算最终结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 对应公式：S[i] * a[i+1]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans += prefix_sum[i] * a[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 例二：可获得的最小取值</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; 题目来源：蓝桥云课</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 题目分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">题目通常涉及两种操作，且需要求最小代价。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> **排序预处理**：首先将数组 $a[]$ 从小到大排序。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> **操作策略**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">   - 操作(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)：在数组尾部选取元素。</span><br><span class=\"line\">   - 操作(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)：在数组头部选取<span class=\"number\">2</span>个元素。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**贪心法的陷阱**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">直观上容易想到贪心策略：每次选择代价较小的操作。但贪心法往往是错误的。例如样例 $\\&#123;<span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>\\&#125;$，若 $k=<span class=\"number\">3</span>$：</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 贪心策略：执行<span class=\"number\">3</span>次操作(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)，结果为 $<span class=\"number\">1</span>\\times1 + <span class=\"number\">1</span>\\times1 + <span class=\"number\">1</span>\\times1 = <span class=\"number\">6</span>$（此处逻辑视具体题意而定，假设是累加或特定权值）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 正确策略：执行<span class=\"number\">3</span>次操作(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)，取尾部元素，结果可能更优。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 优化思路：枚举 + 前缀和</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">既然贪心不可行，我们需要遍历所有可能的操作组合。设操作(<span class=\"number\">2</span>)执行了 $p$ 次，则操作(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)执行了 $k-p$ 次。此时总代价公式为：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">$$ Cost(p) = \\sum_&#123;i=<span class=\"number\">1</span>&#125;^&#123;2p&#125; a_i + \\sum_&#123;i=n-(k-p)+<span class=\"number\">1</span>&#125;^&#123;n&#125; a_i $$</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">若直接按照公式计算，每次验证 $p$ 的复杂度为 $O(n)$，总复杂度为 $O(kn)$，在数据量大时会超时。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**前缀和优化**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">观察公式发现，两部分的求和均可通过前缀和数组直接访问：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> 前半部分（头部 $2p$ 个元素）：即为 `S[2p]`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> 后半部分（尾部 $k-p$ 个元素）：可通过 `S[n] - S[n-(k-p)]` 快速计算。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过前缀和优化，单次验证 $p$ 的复杂度降为 $O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$，整体复杂度优化为 $O(n \\log n + k)$（排序耗时 + 枚举耗时）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 代码逻辑简述</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 伪代码示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># a.sort() </span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># prefix_sum = ... (计算前缀和)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># min_val = infinity</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># for p in range(0, k + 1):</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     head_sum = prefix_sum[2*p]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     tail_count = k - p</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     tail_sum = prefix_sum[n] - prefix_sum[n - tail_count]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#     min_val = min(min_val, head_sum + tail_sum)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">*(注：具体代码边界需根据题目详细要求调整)*</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"算法笔记","path":"api/categories/算法笔记.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"算法","path":"api/tags/算法.json"},{"name":"前缀和","path":"api/tags/前缀和.json"},{"name":"差分","path":"api/tags/差分.json"}]}